  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I was kicked from a group public instance by its owner/moderator, but instead of the normal kick reason message I the following message: \"DisconnectByDisconnectMessage\"\n\nIt wasn't until I tried to rejoin the instance that I realized what had happened.\n\nThe log looks interesting too:\n\n- 2024.06.01 15:27:13 Log        -  [Behaviour] OnDisconnected: DisconnectByDisconnectMessage\n\n- 2024.06.01 15:27:13 Error      -  [Behaviour] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.photonengine.io:5058', MasterServerAddress: '668CC83F6E85FB351CCF5C6578BB0ADB.exitgames.com:5055', GameServerAddress: '216.120.180.173:5056', Code: 'DisconnectByDisconnectMessage', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '1790694.402' }}\n\n- 2024.06.01 15:27:13 Log        -  [Behaviour] Disconnected: DisconnectByDisconnectMessage with Reason: You have been kicked from the instance",
